leazar, the son of Aaron the priest, saw [it], he rose up from among the congregation, and took a javelin in his hand; And he went after the man of Israel into the tent, and thrust both of them through, the man of Israel, and the woman through her belly. So the plague was stayed from the children of Israel.","wj":null,"reference":"Numbers 25:7\u20138","book":"Numbers","chapter":25,"v1":7,"v2":8,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/Numbers\/25\/7-8"},{"id":831896,"text":"Women received their dead raised to life again: and others were tortured, not accepting deliverance; that they might obtain a better resurrection: And others had trial of [cruel] mockings and scourgings, yea, moreover of bonds and imprisonment: They were stoned, they were sawn asunder, were tempted, were slain with the sword: they wandered about in sheepskins and goatskins; being destitute, afflicted, tormented; (Of whom the world was not worthy:) they wandered in deserts, and [in] mountains, and [in] dens and caves of the earth.","wj":null,"reference":"Hebrews 11:35\u201338","book":"Hebrews","chapter":11,"v1":35,"v2":38,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/Hebrews\/11\/35-38"},{"id":817802,"text":"I have set the point of the sword against all their gates, that [their] heart may faint, and [their] ruins be multiplied: ah! [it is] made bright, [it is] wrapped up for the slaughter.","wj":null,"reference":"Ezekiel 21:15","book":"EZE","chapter":21,"v1":15,"v2":15,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/EZE\/21\/15"},{"id":831004,"text":"And have no fellowship with the unfruitful works of darkness, but rather reprove [them].","wj":null,"reference":"Ephesians 5:11","book":"Ephesians","chapter":5,"v1":11,"v2":11,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/Ephesians\/5\/11"},{"id":804798,"text":"And the king said unto her, Be not afraid: for what sawest thou? And the woman said unto Saul, I saw gods ascending out of the earth.","wj":null,"reference":"1 Samuel 28:13","book":"1 Samuel","chapter":28,"v1":13,"v2":13,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/1%20Samuel\/28\/13"},{"id":831244,"text":"For I bear him record, that he hath a great zeal for you, and them [that are] in Laodicea, and them in Hierapolis.","wj":null,"reference":"Colossians 4:13","book":"Colossians","chapter":4,"v1":13,"v2":13,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/Colossians\/4\/13"},{"id":798333,"text":"Dan shall be a serpent by the way, an adder in the path, that biteth the horse heels, so that his rider shall fall backward.","wj":null,"reference":"Genesis 49:17","book":"Genesis","chapter":49,"v1":17,"v2":17,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/Genesis\/49\/17"},{"id":831807,"text":"For if the blood of bulls and of goats, and the ashes of an heifer sprinkling the unclean, sanctifieth to the purifying of the flesh: How much more shall the blood of Christ, who through the eternal Spirit offered himself without spot to God, purge your conscience from dead works to serve the living God?","wj":null,"reference":"Hebrews 9:13\u201314","book":"Hebrews","chapter":9,"v1":13,"v2":14,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/Hebrews\/9\/13-14"},{"id":817477,"text":"Then I looked, and, behold, in the firmament that was above the head of the cherubims there appeared over them as it were a sapphire stone, as the appearance of the likeness of a throne.","wj":null,"reference":"Ezekiel 10:1","book":"EZE","chapter":10,"v1":1,"v2":1,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/EZE\/10\/1"},{"id":817299,"text":"The elders have ceased from the gate, the young men from their musick.","wj":null,"reference":"Lamentations 5:14","book":"Lamentations","chapter":5,"v1":14,"v2":14,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/Lamentations\/5\/14"},{"id":829150,"text":"Wherefore my sentence is, that we trouble not them, which from among the Gentiles are turned to God: But that we write unto them, that they abstain from pollutions of idols, and [from] fornication, and [from] things strangled, and [from] blood.","wj":null,"reference":"Acts 15:19\u201320","book":"Acts","chapter":15,"v1":19,"v2":20,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/Acts\/15\/19-20"},{"id":799050,"text":"And thou shalt cast four rings of gold for it, and put [them] in the four corners thereof; and two rings [shall be] in the one side of it, and two rings in the other side of it.","wj":null,"reference":"Exodus 25:12","book":"Exodus","chapter":25,"v1":12,"v2":12,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/Exodus\/25\/12"},{"id":814603,"text":"Woe unto [them that are] wise in their own eyes, and prudent in their own sight!","wj":null,"reference":"Isaiah 5:21","book":"Isaiah","chapter":5,"v1":21,"v2":21,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/Isaiah\/5\/21"},{"id":797748,"text":"With whomsoever thou findest thy gods, let him not live: before our brethren discern thou what [is] thine with me, and take [it] to thee. For Jacob knew not that Rachel had stolen them.","wj":null,"reference":"Genesis 31:32","book":"Genesis","chapter":31,"v1":32,"v2":32,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/Genesis\/31\/32"},{"id":820738,"text":"For though they flourish in branches for a time; yet standing not last, they shall be shaken with the wind, and through the force of winds they shall be rooted out.","wj":null,"reference":"Wisdom of Solomon 4:4","book":"WIS","chapter":4,"v1":4,"v2":4,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/WIS\/4\/4"},{"id":830657,"text":"For the administration of this service not only supplieth the want of the saints, but is abundant also by many thanksgivings unto God; Whiles by the experiment of this ministration they glorify God for your professed subjection unto the gospel of Christ, and for [your] liberal distribution unto them, and unto all [men]; And by their prayer for you, which long after you for the exceeding grace of God in you.","wj":null,"reference":"2 Corinthians 9:12\u201314","book":"2 Corinthians","chapter":9,"v1":12,"v2":14,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/2%20Corinthians\/9\/12-14"},{"id":818853,"text":"And he informed [me], and talked with me, and said, O Daniel, I am now come forth to give thee skill and understanding.","wj":null,"reference":"Daniel 9:22","book":"Daniel","chapter":9,"v1":22,"v2":22,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/Daniel\/9\/22"},{"id":804933,"text":"So do God to Abner, and more also, except, as the LORD hath sworn to David, even so I do to him; To translate the kingdom from the house of Saul, and to set up the throne of David over Israel and over Judah, from Dan even to Beer-sheba.","wj":null,"reference":"2 Samuel 3:9\u201310","book":"2 Samuel","chapter":3,"v1":9,"v2":10,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/2%20Samuel\/3\/9-10"},{"id":823454,"text":"Whereof when Demetrius heard, he was very sorry, and said, What have we done, that Alexander hath prevented us in making amity with the Jews to strengthen himself?","wj":null,"reference":"1 Maccabees 10:22\u201323","book":"1MA","chapter":10,"v1":22,"v2":23,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/1MA\/10\/22-23"},{"id":811429,"text":"My confusion [is] continually before me, and the shame of my face hath covered me, For the voice of him that reproacheth and blasphemeth; by reason of the enemy and avenger.","wj":null,"reference":"Psalms 44:15\u201316","book":"Psalms","chapter":44,"v1":15,"v2":16,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/Psalms\/44\/15-16"},{"id":806067,"text":"And it was [so], when Ahijah heard the sound of her feet, as she came in at the door, that he said, Come in, thou wife of Jeroboam; why feignest thou thyself [to be] another? for I [am] sent to thee [with] heavy [tidings].","wj":null,"reference":"1 Kings 14:6","book":"1 Kings","chapter":14,"v1":6,"v2":6,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/1%20Kings\/14\/6"},{"id":810086,"text":"[But] I would strengthen you with my mouth, and the moving of my lips should asswage [your grief].","wj":null,"reference":"Job 16:5","book":"Job","chapter":16,"v1":5,"v2":5,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/Job\/16\/5"},{"id":814937,"text":"And it shall come to pass after the end of seventy years, that the LORD will visit Tyre, and she shall turn to her hire, and shall commit fornication with all the kingdoms of the world upon the face of the earth.","wj":null,"reference":"Isaiah 23:17","book":"Isaiah","chapter":23,"v1":17,"v2":17,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/Isaiah\/23\/17"},{"id":805999,"text":"And he said unto them, Depart yet [for] three days, then come again to me. And the people departed.","wj":null,"reference":"1 Kings 12:5","book":"1 Kings","chapter":12,"v1":5,"v2":5,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/1%20Kings\/12\/5"},{"id":819220,"text":"Thus saith the LORD; For three transgressions of the children of Ammon, and for four, I will not turn away [the punishment] thereof; because they have ripped up the women with child of Gilead, that they might enlarge their border: But I will kindle a fire in the wall of Rabbah, and it shall devour the palaces thereof, with shouting in the day of battle, with a tempest in the day of the whirlwind: And their king shall go into captivity, he and his princes together, saith the LORD.","wj":null,"reference":"Amos 1:13\u201315","book":"Amos","chapter":1,"v1":13,"v2":15,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/Amos\/1\/13-15"},{"id":824012,"text":"Now I beseech those that read this book, that they be not discouraged for these calamities, but that they judge those punishments not to be for destruction, but for a chastening of our nation.","wj":null,"reference":"2 Maccabees 6:12","book":"2MA","chapter":6,"v1":12,"v2":12,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/2MA\/6\/12"},{"id":811254,"text":"[A Psalm] of David. Plead [my cause], O LORD, with them that strive with me: fight against them that fight against me.","wj":null,"reference":"Psalms 35:1","book":"Psalms","chapter":35,"v1":1,"v2":1,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/Psalms\/35\/1"},{"id":829039,"text":"And as Peter knocked at the door of the gate, a damsel came to hearken, named Rhoda.","wj":null,"reference":"Acts 12:13","book":"Acts","chapter":12,"v1":13,"v2":13,"complete":true,"link":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/bible-corner\/#\/p\/kjva\/Acts\/12\/13"}],"translation":"eng-kjv","bible":"\/bible-corner\/","picture":"https:\/\/knowingjesus.today\/wp-content\/plugins\/kjt-local-bible\/assets\/verse-picture.js?ver=4.117.0"};
